# GD-24 (round 19, writer 10): settled; was REFCORE-UNSPECIFIED §2.4. L §2.4: "a same item by its left side (as an item whose target and keys are its left side's)": bank before fee.
# The old comment:
# L §2.4 sorts version items "entries into kinds and indexes first, then by target id"; a `same` item (L §5.19, §6.1)
# names two rows and has no target id, and the section gives it no place among the others: REFCORE-UNSPECIFIED.
=== options reprint
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

input bank: observed
input fee[mo in months]: money PLN

version v
  cite s
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  fee[2026-03] = 2 PLN
  same bank[r1] = fee[2026-03]
